  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.4.1: Fixed ELEDataGridView tables with a vertical scrollbar losing the last row at the bottom and leaving a blank gap under it — the visible-row count now only counts whole rows and is always measured from the first row, and in free-size mode the row area snaps to a whole number of rows (shrinking the control height to match) so the last row always sits flush against the bottom edge; added a paginated table demo combining ELEDataGridView with ELEPagination (re-slices the data source on page or page-size change); fixed ELEScrollPanel content disappearing when it hosts a Dock=Fill child (content height is now floored to one viewport so it cannot self-lock at zero)",
